# Tree trunk (#349, D80): the decor kind `trunk`, native 16x288, one frame, standing on the floor; branches are
# one-way Platform / FallingPlatform objects drawn over it. Decor tier (D76): no ink, contour in its own hue, a muted
# grey-brown near the level background's lightness (D92), no accent hue. Not solid, never moves.
# Layered-forest palette (#236): a dark slate just above the decor ink floor (OKLab L 0.301 to 0.311, INK_L_MAX 0.30), so it
# sits in forest-1's near-black play band and the night blue of forest-0 and forest-2 alike (D76, check_contrast.py); the
# earlier night values (D92, #430) and the day values are in docs/ART_DIRECTION.md.
size 16 288
color c 2a2e38
color b 2b2f3a
color l 2d303b
color n 2b2e39
frame trunk
